<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37616" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξορύσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξόρμ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dig out</i> the earth from a
			trench, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἀεὶ ἐξορυσσόμενον χοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποι ἐξορυσσόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					833b4
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξορύξασθαι χάρακας</span>
			<i>make oneself</i> a vallum, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				9.55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dig out</i> of the ground, <i>dig up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς νεκρούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.64
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1024iv4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv/v A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγλιθας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					763
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μορίαν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				7.26
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ χοὸς τοῦ -ομένου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHal.</u>
					1.109
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυτά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					19.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>gouge out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. αὐτῶν τοὺς ὀφθαλμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.116
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				16.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Art.</u>
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἐξορύσσοντα λόγον τὰ κεκρυμμένα
					τῶν πραγμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.72
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
